  "title": "LashPop admin owner capability contract",
  "purpose": "The release-critical list of plain-English owner tasks, including what must happen outside Admin when a task cannot be completed safely here.",
  "outsideAdmin": [
    "Vagaro owns service prices, durations, appointment availability, booking destinations, and synced stylist facts.",
    "After the owner adds a new service in Vagaro and runs a sync, the website manager must create and check its Vagaro booking link and publish the reviewed website change. Admin keeps the service hidden until this is complete.",
    "Changing the approved website design, navigation or legal page structure requires a reviewed code change.",
    "Admin can change the Work with us introduction, path summaries and photos. Benefits, prices, forms and policy rules require a reviewed website change."
  ],
